WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.469
-It sure is
spooky out here tonight.

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:04.003
When I'm spooked,
what makes me feel better

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:07.040
is telling scary stories.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.441
-I got a really scary story.

00:00:09.441 --> 00:00:12.211
Do you know the one about
the man with the hooked hands?

00:00:12.211 --> 00:00:14.046
-No, no,
not those kinds of stories.

00:00:14.046 --> 00:00:15.948
Real scary stories.

00:00:15.948 --> 00:00:17.850
-How real are we talking?

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:21.988
Like, real-real or
real-real-real?

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:24.790
-Real-real-real.

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:26.292
I'll go first.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:30.497
This one will send shivers down
the curvature of your spine.

00:00:34.266 --> 00:00:37.036
Years back, there was an
old barn up on the hill,

00:00:37.036 --> 00:00:39.672
and there was a wedding
in that barn.

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:41.607
And I was invited as a plus-one.

00:00:41.607 --> 00:00:43.576
I didn't know
a single soul there.

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:46.879
[ Both gasp ]
That's not even the worst part.

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:49.048
The worst part was...

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:50.683
they weren't serving alcohol!

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:51.884
[ Screaming ]

00:00:51.884 --> 00:00:56.756
I had to talk to people, yeah.
Who does that?

00:00:56.756 --> 00:00:58.191
-I peed a little in my pants.

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:00.926
-Okay, all right.
Yeah, all right.

00:01:00.926 --> 00:01:03.863
Yeah. Sorry.
-But I have an even scarier one.

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:04.864
-What?

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:08.067
-This one will chill you
to the bone.

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:10.870
It was my birthday.

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:14.773
A guy at work said,
"Hey, happy birthday."

00:01:14.773 --> 00:01:15.942
-And then?

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:18.978
-I said, "Thanks. You too."

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:20.313
[ Screaming ]

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:23.049
-That's a soc...

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:26.286
That's a social faux pas.
-It's true.

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:30.589
A so-faux pas.
-Yeah.

00:01:30.589 --> 00:01:33.025
-Okay, you think
those are scary?

00:01:33.025 --> 00:01:37.429
Okay.
I was once on a date with a guy.

00:01:37.429 --> 00:01:40.233
I know. Weird, right?

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:42.134
He seemed normal, you know?

00:01:42.134 --> 00:01:44.136
But out of nowhere,
he said something

00:01:44.136 --> 00:01:46.705
that will haunt me
until the day of die.

00:01:46.705 --> 00:01:48.007
-No.

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:50.242
-Yeah, I can sometimes
hear it at night.

00:01:50.242 --> 00:01:51.244
-What'd he say?

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:53.346
-He said...

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:54.880
"I hope you like vape tricks."

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:56.883
-Oh, my gosh.
-I have...

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:58.451
-Oh, my gosh.
-...chills.

00:01:58.451 --> 00:01:59.852
-Oh, my gosh.

00:01:59.852 --> 00:02:02.588
-And then he did vape tricks.

00:02:02.588 --> 00:02:04.223
-No, no! Oh, my God.

00:02:04.223 --> 00:02:06.926
With the rings and --
Yeah, and -- I've seen them.

00:02:06.926 --> 00:02:08.828
Oh, no. Oh, gosh!
-Terrifying.

00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:11.897
-That is so scary.
-So bad.

00:02:11.897 --> 00:02:14.801
-I can do you one worse.

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:18.170
Last year, I had gingivitis.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:21.240
[ Screaming ]

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:24.777
-That's not the scary part.
-Ah!

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:27.480
-Anyway, I went for
a checkup recently,

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.649
and the dentist said,
"Looking good.

00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:32.385
I can tell
you've been flossing."

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:34.120
And I looked right at her
and I said --

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:36.689
-No, don't say it!
I can't...

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:39.692
-I said, "You too."
I did it again.

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:42.561
I did it again.
-Similar --

00:02:42.561 --> 00:02:44.130
-Similar scary.
-Similar scary stories.

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:46.432
-It was the double scare.
-Wow.

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:48.968
This one I have for you
is so scary,

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:51.504
the only person I ever
told it to was my therapist.

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:53.639
After that, she quit the biz

00:02:53.639 --> 00:02:56.576
and became a judge on
"Dancing with the Stars."

00:02:56.576 --> 00:03:00.013
Anyway, one day...

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:07.987
I was walking down the street.

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:09.789
And, so,
I saw someone waving at me.

00:03:09.789 --> 00:03:11.190
So I waved back.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:14.360
Then I realized, he was actually
waving to someone behind me,

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:16.596
so I pretended to be
directing traffic.

00:03:16.596 --> 00:03:20.733
I stayed and directed traffic
for three hours.

00:03:20.733 --> 00:03:23.302
And I've gone back there to
direct traffic every day

00:03:23.302 --> 00:03:26.305
since just to
keep up the charade!

00:03:26.305 --> 00:03:27.806
-No!
-I did.

00:03:27.806 --> 00:03:31.143
-No!

00:03:31.143 --> 00:03:33.012
That's nothing.

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:38.917
My skin's a-tinglin' just
thinking about this spooky tale.

00:03:38.917 --> 00:03:41.487
Settle in.
-I'm settled.

00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:45.592
-The other day, I coughed,
but it sounded like a sneeze.

00:03:45.592 --> 00:03:46.959
-Whoa!

00:03:46.959 --> 00:03:50.430
-So someone turned to me and
said, "Bless you."

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:54.800
Then I turned to them
and I said --

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:57.603
-Let me guess.
You said, "You too."

00:03:57.603 --> 00:04:00.673
-No.
I said, "Oil me up, daddy.

00:04:00.673 --> 00:04:03.810
It's dinnertime,
and I'm a little soup boy.

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:04.877
Chompa, chompa."

00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:06.913
[ Screaming ]

00:04:10.283 --> 00:04:13.119
-Hey, is there something
we can do for you?

00:04:13.119 --> 00:04:14.653
-You guys want to see
a bunch of sunset pictures

00:04:14.653 --> 00:04:15.921
I took on my phone?

00:04:15.921 --> 00:04:17.924
[ Screaming ]

